  "_about": "What tools/ArgoniaPlugin seeds into plugin/Argonia/ (PLAN Phase 1, the shutdown). quests_sge_off: vanilla Start Game Enabled quests whose override turns the flag off (the record is the load order's winner, its player-visible text stripped: it never runs). story_nodes_off: vanilla story-manager nodes, children of an event node, given a first condition GetGlobalValue ARG_VanillaStoryManager == 1 (the global is 0), so nothing under them starts. Everything not named here runs as before; mods/allowed-quests.json says why. conditions_from_winner: nodes whose conditions Spriggit 0.41's YAML loses (a GetVMQuestVariable condition beside another of the same function drops one: the ESP Mutagen writes is right, the serialised YAML is short); `plugin.sh build` re-copies their conditions from the load order's winner after deserialising, and the read-back proves the count. The four free Creation Club files (every 1.6+ install has them) are masters for the creation club group (owner ruling via the coordinator, 2026-11-05).",
